REFERENCE   3  (residues 1 to 140)
  AUTHORS   Englert,C., Wanner,G. and Pfeifer,F.
  TITLE     Functional analysis of the gas vesicle gene cluster of the
            halophilic archaeon Haloferax mediterranei defines the vac-region
            boundary and suggests a regulatory role for the gvpD gene or its
